/E (The MBA orientation program is a series of events that aims at assisting the students to develop an understanding of the Management Education. This program is conducted by the college management for the sake of students who step into their Professional Environment. The program helps students to interact with Industry Experts specialised in different sectors, Entrepreneurs from various fields and Professional Bodies. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
